There are many differences in the functions of the pepper grinder, we introduce a few common points to analyze how to choose from functions.
If you want to use it in a hot and humid kitchen, stainless steel that is not easy to rust is a good choice, and it can also be used to grind rock salt. However, stainless steel is softer than other metals and is prone to wear after long-term use.
Ceramic is a strong material, in addition to not rusting, it can also grind rock salt. In addition, the aroma of pepper is easily lost due to the heat generated during grinding, but the ceramic material is not prone to generate frictional heat, so it can effectively maintain the original aroma of pepper.
The two-hand twist type pepper grinder can be easily disassembled and cleaned due to its simple internal structure, but most other types of products cannot be disassembled, which greatly increases the difficulty of cleaning and maintenance. Even if it is a model that can be dismantled, in order to avoid residual moisture after cleaning and causing rust, it is recommended that you use a clean dry cloth to wipe it instead of rinsing with clean water.
