In order to reduce the thickness of the screen protector, no glue on the middle of the glass and 0.25mm glass can reduce the thickness of the screen protector effectively. In addition, in order to enhance fingerprint unlock, in the unlock area has been added a special fingerprint sticker.
The special adhesive layer with thick glue around and thin glue in the middle is used to solve the problem of curved screen fitting. Meanwhile, 0.25 glass with thin glue reduces the thickness of the protective film in the unlocking area, so as to effectively solve the problem of ultrasonic fingerprint unlocking.
UV glue to solve the curved screen ultrasonic fingerprint unlocking method, from his more special installation method. Drop UV glue on the surface of the mobile phone, cover with 0.25 glass so that the glue naturally flow flat, before UV lamp curing, with the matching weight pressure in the fingerprint unlock an area, so that the glue in the fingerprint unlock area is thin so that the thickness of the overall protective film in the area is reduced.
The thickness of the overall substrate layer and glue layer of PMMA is only 0.29mm, which is similar to the thickness of the glass layer of the tempered film. As a soft film, there is no problem in the degree of adhesion on the curved screen, and the overall thickness has successfully solved the ultrasonic fingerprint unlock
