‘Living Well, Taking Control’
Would you like help to prevent or manage type 2 diabetes?
‘Living Well, Taking Control’ aims to:
‘Living Well, Taking Control’ matches you up with a trained health buddy who understands type 2 diabetes and the difficulties linked to the condition.
For 12 months, you can meet your buddy face-to-face, or chat on the phone, or contact them through text and email – whatever suits you best.
Balance is a skill that can be trained and improved.
I’ve watched people who have been virtually housebound because of their fear of falling become active and start enjoying their lives again.
