A Change4life Champion is a local resident, volunteer or worker from east and west Newcastle who volunteers their time to attend a C4L Champion workshop.
Anyone can become a Champion as long as they have somewhere to spread the C4L key messages.
All Champions are different and they can do a variety of things from simply registering their setting as a C4L supporter, putting up a display or making sure C4L information is available to people.
It’s up to the individual Champion and their setting todecide what they’d like to do.
