Let me just briefly explain that the “Cashmere” of the “cashmere sweater” refers to the thin layer of wool under the long outer hair on the goat. If you have a pet with long hair, you can touch it carefully.
According to national regulations, cashmere sweaters with more than 95% content can be said to be 100% cashmere sweaters. At least 30% cashmere content is required to be called cashmere sweater.
I believe this is the biggest problem that puzzles most people. After repeated inquiries, the best way to answer is “burning”.
If you are a big man who has come into contact with real pure cashmere sweaters, I suggest you start with touching; But if you haven’t touched the pure cashmere sweater, it’s hard to judge that the “slippery”, “soft” and “wool” of your hand feel are the touch of the real cashmere sweater.
This is not to say that cashmere sweaters that cannot be twisted into gray are not good. It only shows that the composition is not high.
In fact, in the absence of professional testing institutions, even the producers of cashmere sweaters cannot judge the content of cashmere sweaters in the market out of thin air. Because the twist, count, weaving method and tightness of yarn may affect the final feel of cashmere sweater.
It is a good choice to buy brand cashmere sweaters, provided that they are purchased through “formal and reliable channels”.
