Metal mesh cylinder: The above steam chamber and steaming chamber are fixed, while the metal mesh cylinder is running, fresh leaves are continuously fed and steam from the steaming chamber is obtained during constant stirring, and steamed to achieve steaming. After the request, they were continuously eliminated.
Stirring shaft: The function is to effectively stir the steamed green leaves in the metal mesh cylinder to ensure that the supply of the leaves is not hindered. The steamed leaves are sent out in the order of first-in, first-out, and last-in.
6 .Drive unit: It consists of electric motor, reduction gear, stepless speed change mechanism, etc. The metal mesh cylinder and the stirring shaft rotate at a given speed and a certain transmission ratio.
