The reason why the drain valve does not water
Failure: the water inlet valve is slow to enter the water (1)
Remedy: First, remove the decorative cover, lever arm and valve cover, and then clean the water sealing nail of the lever arm and the water sealing sheet of the valve cover. Finally, put the valve cover, lever arm, and decorative cover back in place before use.
Remedy: Loosen the lock nut, and then wash the lock nut with clean water.
Failure: the water inlet valve does not enter the water
Remedy: Clean the float with clean water and check whether other parts are covered.
Remedy: wash the water-sealing sheet with clean water and check whether there is any sundry when the water-sealing sheet and the adjusting cup are working.
Failure: the drain valve button cannot be returned after working once
Remedy: If you don’t want to use unqualified water quality and turn the button cylinder of the drain valve, you can rotate it 360° to match the push rod direction. If it is used for too long, it will cause too many impurities to block.
