Establishment of Jinbin: In 2004, China's industry, construction industry, tourism and so on are developing steadily and rapidly. After many times investigating the market environment, understanding the market development needs, responding to the construction of the Bohai Rim Economic Circle, Tianjin Tanggu Jinbin Valve Co., Ltd. was established in May 2004, and passed the ISO quality system certification in the same year.
In 2008, the company's business continued to expand, Jinbin's Second Workshop - welding workshop emerged, and put into use in that year. In the same year, the leadership of the State Bureau of Quality and Technical Supervision inspected Jinbin and gave it high praise.
Meanwhile, Jinbin office building began to be built. In 2009, Mr. Chen Shaoping, General Manager of Tianjin Binhai, stood out in the presidential election of Tianjin Hydraulic Valve Chamber of Commerce, and was elected as the president of the Chamber of Commerce by all votes.
The new office building was completed in 2010 and moved to the new office building in May. At the end of the same year, Jinbin held a national fraternity of dealers, and achieved great success.
