Palletizing robots have a large operating range and good safety performance, in a straight line, and only one motor is used, so the effect of palletizing is very good.
The palletizing robot operates in an open environment, it has an independent linkage mechanism, and it uses a linear conveying track, so it is very smooth and the efficiency of the transmission is also very high.
The palletizing robot uses a linear guideway and the conveyor is a belt type standard part, so it is easy to purchase and replace if there is damage.
Palletizing robots are available in many different sizes, from low to high speed, so the range of options is very wide.
Most of the palletizing robot parts are on the bottom, the arm is flexible, and the power consumption is slow, which is energy saving and environmental protection. And even in high-speed operation, the reliability is very high.
Palletizing robots have a wide variety of types and specifications, and can be used in a variety of environments, and are suitable for a wide range of applications.
