Three major advantages of balance crane.
The arm part of the counterbalance crane is designed according to the principle of balance with the encounter, and at the same time, the weight of the object at the hook (lifting weight) does not destroy this balance state. Only a small rolling friction resistance needs to be overcome when moving.
