Should everyone who is interested in grooming have such a vacuum cleaner?
Are you wondering what blackheads are and how they are formed?
Wągry is a colloquial term for blackheads. What are blackheads?
Despite the fairly good condition of my skin, I have blackheads which appear mainly on my nose and chin. They are mainly observed in people with acne-prone skin, but they can also occur in the absence of any other skin problems.
closed - white, fine, well visible after stretching the skin;
The black color of the blackheads on the nose results from the fact that the oily discharge (so-called sebaceous-horn mass) coming out of them oxidizes.
Let's face it - getting rid of them is really hard and takes a lot of work. That is why I decided to test the Xiaomi device InFace.
Charging time: 2 hours
Soothing effect, moderate suction, no damage to the hair follicles; suitable for women and sensitive skin.
4 different nozzles allow for thorough cleaning of different areas.
After preparing the face, I put the appropriate attachment on the blackhead vacuum cleaner and set its power. I gently dragged it over my face, trying to get rid of blackheads, and at the end I used cosmetics that help close the pores.
It also made me not too eager to test. However, I did read a bit about internet use and was finally able to master the vacuum cleaner.
The disadvantage of the device is too sensitive panel touchscreen, so you can unexpectedly reduce or increase the power of the device during operation. The blackhead vacuum cleaner also does not have any compatibility with phones, and it would be useful, if only to check the battery status, which the device does not show.
Various device colors.
With improper use, you can only worsen the condition of the skin (not only further blackheads, but also purulent eruptions may appear).
It is difficult to clean the tips, so we cannot be 100% sure that there are no dirt and bacteria there.
If you're at the beginning of your grooming journey, a vacuum cleaner shouldn't be the first to hit the top of the buying list. However, if you know how to use it and you know how not to hurt yourself - I leave the choice to you.
