Xiaomi purifier in 2020. Ranking of available models
If we have a large apartment or house, the question arises: if I buy one large purifier, will it purify the air in the whole apartment? Unfortunately not.
It is best to designate the places where you want the purifier and focus on them. The main two places are the living room where we spend the most time and the bedroom where we sleep.
Mi Air Purifier 2S is a very good purifier, but its successors have already appeared on the market at similar prices. The purifier has been on the market for several years and is currently in price and performance between 2H and 3H.
Fortunately, this has changed with the next Xiaomi purifiers and now we do not have this problem anymore. You will buy 2S pod tym linkiem .
It is still more powerful than the ProH, but also much bigger and heavier. Therefore, the places for its use are very limited and if you need a large purifier, the Mi Air Purifier ProH may be a better solution.
So if you have a really large living room or a small restaurant room, it will be perfect. However, if you want to buy it so that it cleans the air in the whole apartment, we advise you against it.
Its performance has also been significantly increased. Compared to the usual Pro, we have a jump from 500 m3 / h to 600 m3 / h. The ability to operate in larger rooms (from 60 sq m to 72 sq m) has also been improved.
The only downside of this purifier is the lack of a Hepa H13 filter, which can be found in the version with the note H.
It has lower performance than the 2s or 3 series and the total lack of an OLED screen. Its operating area is also much smaller, because it is designed for rooms that are a little over 20 meters.
It has great performance, can be automated in the Xiaomi Home App, it has a new filter and a great price. We recommend this purifier with your hand on your heart.
It catches pollution faster. Adding a Hepa H13 filter is the last element that was missing in the regular version 3.
In relation to the 2S version, automation is also a big advantage. Even living in Europe, we are not disadvantaged - the automation works on the same principle as in China.
An important advantage of the purifier is the Hepa H13 filter. If you buy a purifier now, then pay attention to it, because the difference in price is small and the difference in health care is quite large.
